{"id":"sa_bado","lemma":"sábado","pos":"noun","rank":1244,"glosses":["Saturday","Sabbath, sabbath"],"ipa":"/ˈsa.bɐ.du/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/04/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Santamarcanda-s%C3%A1bado.wav/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Santamarcanda-s%C3%A1bado.wav.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"sábados"},"examples":[{"text":"Tom vem aqui quase todo sábado.","en":"Tom comes here almost every Saturday.","words":[{"g":"tone"},{"g":"to come","l":"vir"},{"g":"here"},{"g":"almost"},{"g":"every"},null]},{"text":"Não vamos à escola aos sábados.","en":"We don't go to school on Saturdays.","words":[{"g":"not / no"},{"g":"let's go"},{"g":"to the"},{"g":"school"},null,null]},{"text":"Hoje é sábado, e amanhã será domingo.","en":"Today is Saturday and tomorrow is Sunday.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1270353","words":[{"g":"today"},{"g":"is","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"and"},{"g":"tomorrow"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"on a Sunday"}]},{"text":"O banco não abre aos sábados.","en":"The bank is closed on Saturdays.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"bank"},{"g":"not / no"},{"g":"to open","l":"abrir"},null,null]},{"text":"Vocês abrem no sábado?","en":"Are you open on Saturday?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/845186","words":[{"g":"you (pl.)"},{"g":"to open","l":"abrir"},{"g":"in the"},null]}]}